        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "In order to benchmark the performance of the recently developed stepwise Monte\r\nCarlo method for RNA 3D structure prediction, we assembled a test set of dozens\r\nof common RNA motifs. Sufficiently accurate prediction of these crucial motifs\r\nwould enormously accelerate structure prediction for entire folded RNAs.",
